              (K0 + 1) beta (L n))
            beta (L n) p -
          roughCanonicalAggregateRawRowCorrection W n
            (upperTailLength c n) (K0 + 1) deltaStar
            (roughHeadBalancedAlpha W n (upperTailLength c n)
